# AI Financial Research Agent

An **Agentic AI-powered Financial Research System** that automates investment research by combining multiple financial data sources, AI planning, tool execution, memory, verification, and report generation.

Built using **LangChain, Groq Llama 3.3, ChromaDB, Streamlit, Yahoo Finance, SEC EDGAR**, and a **Plan-and-Execute Agent Architecture**.

---

#  Features

- Plan-and-Execute AI Agent Architecture
- Company Profile Analysis
- Financial Statement Analysis
- Latest Financial News Retrieval
- SEC Filing Analysis
- Three Memory Systems
  -Short-Term Memory
  -Long-Term Memory (ChromaDB)
  -Episodic Memory
-AI-based Report Verification
-Professional Investment Report Generation
-Streamlit Web Interface
-Automatic Report Storage

---

# 🏗️ System Architecture

```text
                           User
                             │
                             ▼
                 Financial Research Agent
                             │
        ┌────────────────────┴────────────────────┐
        │                                         │
        ▼                                         ▼
 Planner Agent                          Memory System
        │                     ┌──────────┼───────────┐
        ▼                     ▼          ▼           ▼
 Creates Execution Plan   Short-Term  Long-Term  Episodic
        │                  Memory      Memory     Memory
        ▼
 Executor Agent
        │
        ▼
 Tool Registry
        │
 ┌──────┼────────┬──────────────┬
 ▼      ▼        ▼              ▼
Company Financial  News      SEC Filing
 Tool     Tool     Tool         Tool
        │
        ▼
 Synthesizer Agent
        │
        ▼
 Verifier Agent
        │
        ▼
 Report Generator
        │
        ▼
 Markdown Report
        │
        ▼
 Streamlit Interface
```

